{"pageid": 746, "title": "Noah", "revid": 1899, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "LGBTQIA+", "Children", "Deceased", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Noah</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dd/Noah.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215172545\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Noah\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dd/Noah.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215172545\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dd/Noah.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215172545 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dd/Noah.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215172545 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Noah\" width=\"270\" height=\"351\" data-image-key=\"Noah.png\" data-image-name=\"Noah.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Student</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bisected by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype mother</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #1</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #6</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Noah</b> was a young boy living in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> in 2020. A friend of <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Karl\" title=\"Karl\">Karl</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Tyler_Monitz\" title=\"Tyler Monitz\">Tyler Monitz</a>, Noah was killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype mother</span> while at a sleepover with his friends.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Noah was a friend of <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Tyler_Monitz\" title=\"Tyler Monitz\">Tyler Monitz</a>; he and the latter encouraged James to ask out his crush, <a href=\"/wiki/Karl\" title=\"Karl\">Karl</a>, who later joined their friend group. At one sleepover, the boys were caught trying to sneak out.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC6&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC6-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>At another sleepover, Noah was dared to run around the house naked. Following, Tyler prompted James to talk about the monster he had seen in the ravine. Noah calls bullshit on his story, so James dares the boys to all go to the bridge and check.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Noah angrily does so, upset that they have to walk all the way down there to look for his \"made-up monster.\" He shouts that he is brave, only to see an <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">monster</span> approaching.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC6&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC6-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> James is separated from the group; when he returns, Noah is barely alive, and has been cut in half by the creature. He tells James that he can't feel his legs, and begs for him to take him with him, before dying from his injuries.\n</p><p>While the deaths would be blamed on a bear originally, people suspected James of killing his friends for a while. A memorial was placed up for Noah and the other boys at <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak High School (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX0hpZ2hfU2Nob29sP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak High School</span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Eventually, his death would be blamed on <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Noah is a young Caucasian boy with dark hair.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">Issue #1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\">Issue #6</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"e9be29e71d2cbb9402cf59e277ca28d7\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Noah-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:142px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Noah.png\" title=\"Noah.png (744 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:142px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/dd/Noah.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/142?cb=20241215172545\" title=\"Noah.png (744 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Issue #1\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Noah.png\" data-image-key=\"Noah.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Noah.png (744 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Issue #1\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Noah.png\" data-image-key=\"Noah.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-childr